  <item>
    <title>EP15. 草原的风，是乘风破浪的样子，乘风2025，再见👋</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6848e5ea1c45a6323292ba11</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6848e5ea1c45a6323292ba11</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 11 Jun 2025 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这次，是在不同城市间奔波的途中，也是在高空中写给你们的一封信。</span></p><span></span><p><span>《乘风2025》总决选刚刚落幕。从呼伦贝尔飞到乌鲁木齐，再飞到长沙……一路上我都在复盘这段旅程。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在回忆的间隙，我想和你们聊聊我的乘风时光，也聊聊十年前的草原、昨天的舞台，还有现在这个，轻松了一点的我❤️</span></p><span></span><p><span>写在云上，留给你们。下期再见！</span></p><span></span><p><span>✈️时间轴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="10">00:10</a> 躺房间里的碎碎念</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="153">02:33</a> 如何忙里偷闲拼命练舞</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="345">05:45</a> 草原，姐姐们，还有那个夏天</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="491">08:11</a> 会昌戏剧节的惊喜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="634">10:34</a> 陪我一起坐飞机吧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1065">17:45</a> 总决选之夜的挑战</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1224">20:24</a> 我想对你们说的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1337">22:17</a> 啊啊啊偶像合体了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1489">24:49</a> 意外的完美，和圆满的句号</span></p><span></span><p><span>🔗 关于</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 谢娜微博：</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/1192329374" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/1192329374"><span>[@谢娜]</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>- 谢娜小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5bace51a8abbba0001db7f42?xsec_token=YBz_OvrMJIoYc3b6v1S_ifdP6NsE5E5MiL-jDomZLfd8o=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5c04c1f200000000080129dd&amp;apptime=1739896997&amp;share_id=826d9213da4045e49afe3a6770e58977" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5bace51a8abbba0001db7f42?xsec_token=YBz_OvrMJIoYc3b6v1S_ifdP6NsE5E5MiL-jDomZLfd8o=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5c04c1f200000000080129dd&amp;apptime=1739896997&amp;share_id=826d9213da4045e49afe3a6770e58977"><span>[@谢娜]</span></a></p>