  <item>
    <title>EP14. 最想做的事</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6836881a38dcc57c6457eca7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6836881a38dcc57c6457eca7</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 28 May 2025 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这期聊了点不一样的情绪，但我特别想留下来，分享给你们。</span></p><span></span><p><span>成年后，我们的日常节奏很快，但回家的路，总是慢半拍。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我是从北京飞回老家之前在车上录的，有点絮叨，有点感性，也有点想家。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你最近也在忙忙碌碌，我想说，别停止想家的念头。</span></p><span></span><p><span>等有机会了，就回一趟家吧。看一眼爸妈，吃一口小时候的味道。那种感觉，比什么都踏实。</span></p><span></span><p><span>🔗 关于</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 谢娜微博：</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/1192329374" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/1192329374"><span>[@谢娜]</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>- 谢娜小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5bace51a8abbba0001db7f42?xsec_token=YBz_OvrMJIoYc3b6v1S_ifdP6NsE5E5MiL-jDomZLfd8o=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5c04c1f200000000080129dd&amp;apptime=1739896997&amp;share_id=826d9213da4045e49afe3a6770e58977" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5bace51a8abbba0001db7f42?xsec_token=YBz_OvrMJIoYc3b6v1S_ifdP6NsE5E5MiL-jDomZLfd8o=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5c04c1f200000000080129dd&amp;apptime=1739896997&amp;share_id=826d9213da4045e49afe3a6770e58977"><span>[@谢娜]</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>📪 听友信箱</span></p><span></span><p><a href="mailto:nanapengyou@outlook.com"><span>nanapengyou@outlook.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>- 征集你的故事，或者对生活各方面的小问题、小兴趣、小分享~ 幸运听友可能会被选中读信哟。</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐：Gather Round the Table</span></p><span></span><p><span>制作：贝小方</span></p>]]></description>
