  <item>
    <title>EP11. 暂停过的热爱，也能再次起飞</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68117caa47ebeede7e1a38e7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68117caa47ebeede7e1a38e7</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 30 Apr 2025 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>晚上好！最近真的好忙，每天在不同的地方拍节目，累到想直接躺倒💫</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期播客，录得有点仓促，可还是想抽一些时间，擦个面膜，拿起手机，跟你们聊聊天。聊聊舞台、聊聊娃、聊聊那些小小的疲惫和大大的快乐。也读了一封很打动我的听众来信。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期想特别送给所有正在努力平衡生活的妈妈们。工作、孩子、自己的梦想，有时候很累，有时候很矛盾，但你一直在走路，也一直在发光。希望听到这期的你，知道自己已经很棒，也值得骄傲🎁</span></p><span></span><p><span>⏱ 时间轴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7">00:07</a> 对于最近的忙碌做个说明</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="429">07:09</a> 护肤播客俩不误</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="924">15:24</a> 读信环节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1170">19:30</a> 谁会没有自我怀疑的时候呢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1380">23:00</a> 走着走着就亮啦</span></p><span></span><p><span>🔗 关于</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 谢娜微博：</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/1192329374" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/1192329374"><span>[@谢娜]</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>- 谢娜小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5bace51a8abbba0001db7f42?xsec_token=YBz_OvrMJIoYc3b6v1S_ifdP6NsE5E5MiL-jDomZLfd8o=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5c04c1f200000000080129dd&amp;apptime=1739896997&amp;share_id=826d9213da4045e49afe3a6770e58977" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5bace51a8abbba0001db7f42?xsec_token=YBz_OvrMJIoYc3b6v1S_ifdP6NsE5E5MiL-jDomZLfd8o=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5c04c1f200000000080129dd&amp;apptime=1739896997&amp;share_id=826d9213da4045e49afe3a6770e58977"><span>[@谢娜]</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>📪 听友信箱</span></p><span></span><p><a href="mailto:nanapengyou@outlook.com"><span>nanapengyou@outlook.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>- 征集你的故事，或者对生活各方面的小问题、小兴趣、小分享~ 幸运听友可能会被选中读信哟。</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐：Evening Reflections</span></p><span></span><p><span>制作：贝小方</span></p>]]></description>
