  <item>
    <title>EP10. 长大是轮流守护彼此</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/680877e37a449ae8582d0576</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">680877e37a449ae8582d0576</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 23 Apr 2025 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>朋友们好，又来说说心里话！</span></p><span></span><p><span>我最近发现，不管是哪一代人，好像都在用同一套“关心话术”传递爱。今天就想跟你们分享一下这些轮流守护彼此的瞬间，都是日常小事，但真的太可爱了😝</span></p><span></span><p><span>其实大人会默默用她们的方式爱你，小朋友也会用自己的方式回应你的爱。听完的你，可能也会忍不住想抱一抱身边的人！</span></p><span></span><p><span>⏱ 时间轴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="57">00:57</a> 小咘芽说的话总是击中我的心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="238">03:58</a> 回家陪陪父母</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="659">10:59</a> 宝贝的首次舞台表现</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1125">18:45</a> 展现真实情绪，做健康滴妈妈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1288">21:28</a> 继续说说我对工作和职责的思考</span></p><span></span><p><span>🔗 关于</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 谢娜微博：</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/1192329374" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/1192329374"><span>[@谢娜]</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>- 谢娜小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5bace51a8abbba0001db7f42?xsec_token=YBz_OvrMJIoYc3b6v1S_ifdP6NsE5E5MiL-jDomZLfd8o=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5c04c1f200000000080129dd&amp;apptime=1739896997&amp;share_id=826d9213da4045e49afe3a6770e58977" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5bace51a8abbba0001db7f42?xsec_token=YBz_OvrMJIoYc3b6v1S_ifdP6NsE5E5MiL-jDomZLfd8o=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5c04c1f200000000080129dd&amp;apptime=1739896997&amp;share_id=826d9213da4045e49afe3a6770e58977"><span>[@谢娜]</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>📪 听友信箱</span></p><span></span><p><a href="mailto:nanapengyou@outlook.com"><span>nanapengyou@outlook.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>- 征集你的故事，或者对生活各方面的小问题、小兴趣、小分享~ 幸运听友可能会被选中读信哟。</span></p>]]></description>
