  <item>
    <title>EP09. 别怕主动，是你在热爱生活</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67ff3e8ccdd692da15a3dd2e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67ff3e8ccdd692da15a3dd2e</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 16 Apr 2025 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我来读信咯！！这阵子一直在拼命工作，终于挤出一点属于自己的时间。</span></p><span></span><p><span>忙完了，心也跟着慢慢静下来，翻翻之前你们写来的信，我就想，今天不能再错过读信的时间了😁嘿嘿。</span></p><span></span><p><span>信里有些小情绪我感同身受，也有些故事让我想起很久以前的自己：有小郁闷的心情，也有快乐到飞起的日子……都是我们生活的一部分。</span></p><span></span><p><span>大家就陪我一起，听听这些带着爱的来信吧。</span></p><span></span><p><span>⏱ 时间轴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7">00:07</a> 日常和彩排的感受</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="173">02:53</a> 第一封来信</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="678">11:18</a> 如何珍惜老朋友又结交新的朋友</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="941">15:41</a> 自我能量的提升</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1243">20:43</a> 保护那个“自己”的重要性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1501">25:01</a> 第二封来信</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1731">28:51</a> 不只是在付出，你同样会收获很多</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1893">31:33</a> 希望她们看到这样的我</span></p><span></span><p><span>🔗 关于</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 谢娜微博：</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/1192329374" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/1192329374"><span>[@谢娜]</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>- 谢娜小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5bace51a8abbba0001db7f42?xsec_token=YBz_OvrMJIoYc3b6v1S_ifdP6NsE5E5MiL-jDomZLfd8o=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5c04c1f200000000080129dd&amp;apptime=1739896997&amp;share_id=826d9213da4045e49afe3a6770e58977" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5bace51a8abbba0001db7f42?xsec_token=YBz_OvrMJIoYc3b6v1S_ifdP6NsE5E5MiL-jDomZLfd8o=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5c04c1f200000000080129dd&amp;apptime=1739896997&amp;share_id=826d9213da4045e49afe3a6770e58977"><span>[@谢娜]</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>📪 听友信箱</span></p><span></span><p><a href="mailto:nanapengyou@outlook.com"><span>nanapengyou@outlook.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>- 征集你的故事，或者对生活各方面的小问题、小兴趣、小分享~ 幸运听友可能会被选中读信哟。</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐：Embers of The Night</span></p><span></span><p><span>制作：贝小方</span></p><span></span><p><span>每周三18点，小宇宙见！✨</span></p>]]></description>
