  <item>
    <title>EP06. 【谢娜】乘风破浪，一起向前</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67e39479af5840b33362880b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67e39479af5840b33362880b</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 26 Mar 2025 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>哈喽~ 今天看了一个视频，被深深感动到了，想和你们分享一下。</span></p><span></span><p><span>人的自信和力量，都会和过去的经历有很大关系，也离不开那些在我们人生路上给我们力量的人。每一次站上这个舞台，我都能感受到过去那些点滴经历的力量。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我很感激每一位在我成长路上给我鼓励和支持的人，正是因为有了你们的陪伴，我才能不断前行☀️</span></p><span></span><p><span>因这个视频而起，我想到很多往事，也想到《乘风》和我这几年的不解之缘，跟你们多说说。</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望我的声音也能带给你们力量，不论是大是小，都很好。无论你现在遇到什么困难，请你保持勇敢，坚持前行！</span></p><span></span><p><span>让我们一起走花路吧 🌸</span></p><span></span><p><span>⏱ 时间轴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="10">00:10</a> 这个视频看得想流泪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="135">02:15</a> 我一定要努力呀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="235">03:55</a> 拍戏、考试、睡钢丝床…奋斗岁月的日常</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="430">07:10</a> 何老师和嘉哥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="671">11:11</a> 和《乘风》的开始</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1033">17:13</a> 我到底是什么时候被说服的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1276">21:16</a> 面对怀疑 能做什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">28:00</a> 我好喜欢今年的姐姐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1983">33:03</a> 女人的一生就是在乘风破浪</span></p><span></span><p><span>🔗 关于</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 谢娜微博：</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/1192329374" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/1192329374"><span>[@谢娜]</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>- 谢娜小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5bace51a8abbba0001db7f42?xsec_token=YBz_OvrMJIoYc3b6v1S_ifdP6NsE5E5MiL-jDomZLfd8o=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5c04c1f200000000080129dd&amp;apptime=1739896997&amp;share_id=826d9213da4045e49afe3a6770e58977" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5bace51a8abbba0001db7f42?xsec_token=YBz_OvrMJIoYc3b6v1S_ifdP6NsE5E5MiL-jDomZLfd8o=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5c04c1f200000000080129dd&amp;apptime=1739896997&amp;share_id=826d9213da4045e49afe3a6770e58977"><span>[@谢娜]</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>🌊提到的节目</span></p><span></span><p><span>《乘风破浪的姐姐》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《偶像来了》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《快乐大本营》</span></p><span></span><p><span>📪 听友信箱</span></p><span></span><p><a href="mailto:nanapengyou@outlook.com"><span>nanapengyou@outlook.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>- 征集你的故事，或者对生活各方面的小问题、小兴趣、小分享~ 幸运听友可能会被选中读信哟。</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐：Rise Up</span></p><span></span><p><span>制作：贝小方</span></p><span></span><p><span>每周三18点，小宇宙见！✨</span></p>]]></description>
