    <title>EP03. 街头逛吃记：快乐不会停</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67c7ac5bbf52a16cd1960828</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67c7ac5bbf52a16cd1960828</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 05 Mar 2025 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>☀️周三好呀，我又来了！今天想和大家聊一聊「快乐」。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我觉得快乐说难也不难，需要多去感受生活中的美好，然后放大它。比如这次在三亚，一整个「面朝大海 胃口大开」，想起了学生时代的街边小吃，尝试了之前没接触的美食。还看到了隐藏的惊喜🌹</span></p><span></span><p><span>虽然都很简单，但我感到非常的幸福！</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望听完这一期能给你一些启发。记得好好吃饭、天天开心！☀️</span></p><span></span><p><span>⏱ 时间轴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8">00:08</a> 分享我听到的海风</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="41">00:41</a> 西红柿的不解之缘</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="318">05:18</a> 第一次尝试这款小吃</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="567">09:27</a> 邂逅美味晚餐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="699">11:39</a> 惊喜与感动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="904">15:04</a> 几个调节情绪的好方法</span></p><span></span><p><span>🔗 关于</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 谢娜微博：</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/1192329374" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/1192329374"><span>[@谢娜]</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>- 谢娜小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5bace51a8abbba0001db7f42?xsec_token=YBz_OvrMJIoYc3b6v1S_ifdP6NsE5E5MiL-jDomZLfd8o=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5c04c1f200000000080129dd&amp;apptime=1739896997&amp;share_id=826d9213da4045e49afe3a6770e58977" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5bace51a8abbba0001db7f42?xsec_token=YBz_OvrMJIoYc3b6v1S_ifdP6NsE5E5MiL-jDomZLfd8o=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5c04c1f200000000080129dd&amp;apptime=1739896997&amp;share_id=826d9213da4045e49afe3a6770e58977"><span>[@谢娜]</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>📪 听友信箱</span></p><span></span><p><a href="mailto:nanapengyou@outlook.com"><span>nanapengyou@outlook.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>- 征集你的故事，或者对生活各方面的小问题、小兴趣~ 幸运听友可能会被选中读信哟。</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐：Tropical Paradise</span></p><span></span><p><